 lan.\n3. Settings › API › create a key. Paste it here or save it as C:\
 \AI\\PERSONA-20260903\\.secrets\\buffer.token.\n4. The whole list with 
 the exact taps is BUFFER-SETUP.md in the persona folder.\n\nThe Days: h
