 ations in OneDrive › WeirdBaby › reels › intake › determinations as w6-
 mon.mp4 … w6-fri.mp4\, and the Numbers in … › intake › numbers with the
  same names.\n3. Tell Code: "week 6 in". The line appends the pop\, wri
 tes the captions and queues them the same day.\n\nThe Days: https://cla
 ude.ai/code/artifact/207ed53f-1abf-4667-82e5-92e3259f4233
